れるもん♪笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NOGIBINGOで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おバカ3位とダンスが不得意2位に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選ばれました(｡-∀-｡)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おバカだということで、イジリーさんに絡んでもらえず、寂しかったです。。。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"確かに、カメラの前とかだと緊張しちゃって、自分で何を言ってるのかわからなくなってしまうけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"文字にしたら誤字はあるかもしれないけど、ちゃんと難しいことも言えるもんね(｡-∀-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間、かりんと話してて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子、そんな言葉知ってるんだねって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"驚かれた(´⊙ω⊙`)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて言ったかは忘れちゃったけどね(´ｰ∀ｰ`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勉強したいなって最近思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"数学とか国語とかももちろんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"動物のこととか、自分の興味があることをもっとたくさん知りたいな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/11/21/4318554/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと前に純奈とカフェにいったの♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短い時間の間で、色んな話をした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、まだまだ話したり足りないね(｡-_-｡)！焼肉じゃ食べることに集中しちゃうから、今度は塩あいすでカフェ巡りしよ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなりましたが、10月お誕生日の方！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハロウィンぽく作ってみました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猫ちゃんかわいい♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/11/21/4318554/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/11/21/4318554/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/11/21/4318554/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/11/21/4318554/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11月お誕生日の方、このブログ記事に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の次くらいのブログにアップします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{